ype, mods)  so much customization that doesn’t even matter.\n\nThe story and world-building suck  they feel rushed and not worked on.\n\nNPCs are bland and boring.\n\nEnemies are annoying and there isn’t a big variety.\n\n2/10 if you wanna play a soulslike dont buy this , if you wanna play a rpg looter shooter dont play this", "timestamp_created": 1755282771, "timestamp_updated": 1764612958, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.351707667112350464", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "202191613", "author": {"steamid": "76561198074718191", "personaname": "TheFrenchFry", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198074718191/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 6158, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2947, "last_played": 1785470190, "avatar": "89e4f4d68bef04c1d71c3701b3231f07494016a6"}, "language": "english", "review": "Definitely play with friends. Solo is fine, but the game was meant and designed for multiple people. \n\nAmazingly fun, great progression and abilities, fun builds to make, awesome boss encounters and enemy design, great randomization. My only critique is the grind can sometimes be a lot, especially if you’re looking for that one item to make your build work, it won’t drop lol. I had a buddy grind for two weeks for a ring and it took that long to drop. \n\nThe fragment system is also kinda wack and annoying, but those are really my only two complaints. Great game and would absolutely recommend it", "timestamp_created": 1755275135, "timestamp_updated": 1755275135, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, 